HEAD:loop/state/decisions.jsonl:41:{"id":"d36","date":"2026-07-11","title":"Volunteer candidacy precedes matching; GitHub link mandatory at signup","decision":"Amends d28: volunteers mark interest in-product (candidate for this project) on public listings; each open project gets an assimilation window (platform-configurable, pilot-tuned) to gather candidates before the concierge enforce-match draws from the accumulated pool. Candidacies feed the admin match log only - no NGO-facing queue, NGO never sees candidacies. REQ-011 listings gain exactly one volunteer action (mark interest); otherwise still read-only. GitHub link becomes mandatory at volunteer signup (supersedes d28 at-first-consent timing; no unlinked volunteer accounts); platform GitHub-org membership still waits for first match consent so repo-creation rights are never granted to never-matched volunteers.","source":"founder review comment on REQ-007 (halved prd-mvp artifact)"}

